  (3040, 452, 4, 'product', 2227, '613447', 'BLADE HACKSAW HAND TUNGSTEN, ALLOY STEEL 300MMX24TEETH  Carbon Steel:   Recommended for general use by engineers, mechanics, electricians, plumbers and maintenance men.  Tungsten Alloy Steel:  Resist breakage, longer wearing and give satisfaction where fast, dependable results are essential.  High Speed Steel:  Heat resistant and suitable for cutting tough alloy steel.  Choose the right blades for the right works.  14 Teeth Per 25.4 mm:  For cutting soft solid steel, iron, rails, brass, bronze, copper and aluminium.  18 Teeth Per 25.4 mm:  For cutting tool steels, iron pipes and light angle iron.  24 Teeth Per 25.4 mm:  For cutting drill rods, medium sheet metal, tubing and solid brass.  32 Teeth Per 25.4 mm:  For cutting thin sheet metal and thin wall tubing.', 2227, 1618, 48.0, 21, 30000.00, 18000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (3041, 452, 5, 'product', 2228, '610405', 'RATCHET HANDLE MALE, 12.7MM/SQ DRIVE 270MM  Drop forged from selected steel with 24 teeth in the ratcheting-gear instead of the usual 16 to 20.  Turning shift lever reverses action instantly.', 2228, 1619, 4.0, 21, 200000.00, 125000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (3042, 452, 6, 'product', 270, '611281', 'WRENCH SET ALLEN HEXAGON, 2.5-12MM 8''S', 270, 1620, 2.0, 19, 125000.00, 75000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (3043, 452, 7, 'product', 1685, '610765', 'WRENCH OPEN & 12-POINT BOX, 10MM  For use in close quarters.  The open end is pointed with slim jaws.  The other end is a thin walled 12 point box head.  Both heads have the same size opening.  Drop forged from tough, selected alloy steel, heat-treated and chrome plated.', 1685, 1621, 6.0, 21, 70000.00, 21500.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (3044, 452, 8, 'product', 1687, '610771', 'WRENCH OPEN & 12-POINT BOX, 17MM  For use in close quarters.  The open end is pointed with slim jaws.  The other end is a thin walled 12 point box head.  Both heads have the same size opening.  Drop forged from tough, selected alloy steel, heat-treated and chrome plated.', 1687, 1172, 6.0, 21, 80000.00, 45500.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (3045, 452, 9, 'product', 1688, '610772', 'WRENCH OPEN & 12-POINT BOX, 19MM  For use in close quarters.  The open end is pointed with slim jaws.  The other end is a thin walled 12 point box head.  Both heads have the same size opening.  Drop forged from tough, selected alloy steel, heat-treated and chrome plated.', 1688, 1622, 6.0, 21, 75000.00, 37500.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (3046, 452, 10, 'product', 1689, '610776', 'WRENCH OPEN & 12-POINT BOX, 24MM  For use in close quarters.  The open end is pointed with slim jaws.  The other end is a thin walled 12 point box head.  Both heads have the same size opening.  Drop forged from tough, selected alloy steel, heat-treated and chrome plated.', 1689, 1174, 6.0, 21, 140000.00, 85000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (3047, 452, 11, 'product', 2229, '611022', 'WRENCH 12-POINT & SPUD END, OFFSET SLIP-ON RSW-29 29MM  Adapted for heavy industrial and automotive work where unusual leverage is necessary.  The 12 point box head insures a firm hold on the nut and it is offset to give maximum clearance.  The long sturdy tapered handle provides ample strength and leverage, and can be easily inserted into bolt holes to bring them into line.  Drop forged from selected alloy steel, heat-treated.', 2229, 1623, 2.0, 21, 520000.00, 370000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (3048, 452, 12, 'product', 2230, '611024', 'WRENCH 12-POINT & SPUD END, OFFSET SLIP-ON RSW-38 38MM  Adapted for heavy industrial and automotive work where unusual leverage is necessary.  The 12 point box head insures a firm hold on the nut and it is offset to give maximum clearance.  The long sturdy tapered handle provides ample strength and leverage, and can be easily inserted into bolt holes to bring them into line.  Drop forged from selected alloy steel, heat-treated.', 2230, 1624, 2.0, 21, 815000.00, 550000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
