  (3887, 626, 1, 'product', 1005, '613056', 'PUNCHING TOOL SET DIES & TABLE, 6-38MM 16''S  Used for punching holes in soft brass, copper, and other soft metals as well as leather, canvas, and gasketing materials. A set for 6 to 38 mm is available as standard, size 40 to 55 mm are available on request and make to order.', 1005, 597, 1.0, 19, 2000000.00, 1300000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
