  (3889, 626, 3, 'product', 2810, '614202', 'CARBORUNDUM PASTE GRIT#2000, MICRO FINE 450GRM  For precision lapping, fitting, surfacing, polishing and other general use in machine shops.  Universally used for grinding valves.  Supplied in 450 grm tin.  Please specify grit number when ordering.', 2810, 2161, 1.0, 34, 68000.00, 46800.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
