  (3915, 626, 29, 'product', 1885, '174272', 'REPLACEABLE HEAD FOR YACHT MOP, WHITE  Made of soft white yarn and fastened to the handle end.  For preventing cross contamination of different areas, various colours of replaceable heads are available for sanitary management.  Length overall is 1,580 mm.', 1885, 2184, 10.0, 21, 50000.00, 31000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (3916, 626, 30, 'product', 2831, '851025', 'HOLDER ELECTRODE CLOSED HEAD, 400AMP  Closed Head  A high quality closed head electrode holder with optimal insulation and powerful grip on the electrodes.   Also be used for overhead welding, and electrodes can be inserted in various manners.   Standards : EN 60974-11.', 2831, 2185, 3.0, 21, 667500.00, 410000.0, 0, FALSE, 1, 1),
