  (4129, 638, 1, 'product', 2980, '233843', 'SHACKLE STRAIGHT EYE BOLT, GALV JIS-M-SD 22MM SWL 2.0TON  A drop forged, carbon steel shackle with an eye bolt which has metric coarse threads at one end.  Please specify Ungalvanized (Black) or Galvanized shackles is required.  Galvanized.  Size: Body dia: 22mm, Opening: 44mm, Screw Pin Thread: M27, Clear Length: 74mm, Pin dia: 27mm, S.W.L: 2ton.', 2980, 2349, 10.0, 21, 75000.00, 42000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4130, 638, 2, 'product', 2981, '614856', 'WHEEL CUT-OFF RESINOID GRAIN36, 100X2.0X9.53MM 4300MTR/MIN  These resin bond cutting wheels have a big advantage over rubber cut-off wheels.  They resist very high cutting heats, have an aggressive cutting action, and a longer disc life.  Grain No. 36 (medium grain) is recommended for general purpose ships use.', 2981, 2350, 72.0, 21, 20000.00, 14000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4131, 638, 3, 'product', 650, '614803', 'WHEEL GRINDING OFFSET RESINOID, 100X6X15MM GRAIN36 4300MTR/MIN  Grain size No. 36 is widely used on ships for all purpose grinding and cutting jobs.  Surface meter per minute 4,300.', 650, 2224, 36.0, 21, 35000.00, 20000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4132, 638, 4, 'product', 2982, '510646', 'BRUSH COUNTER BLACK HAIR  Black bristle or nylon hair for sweeping dust or dirt on desks, counters, or tables.', 2982, 2351, 12.0, 21, 30000.00, 18000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4133, 638, 5, 'product', 2983, '510615', 'BRUSH DECK NYLON 450MM WIDTH, WITH LONG HANDLE  Deck brush with stiff nylon bristles for scrubbing the deck or sweeping floors.  Standard block size is 180 x 60 x 50 (Hair), 300 x 65 x 50 and 450 x 65 x 50 mm.', 2983, 2352, 24.0, 21, 100000.00, 60000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4134, 638, 6, 'product', 1604, '174289', 'FLOOR WIPER (FUITORU MOP), W/LONG HANDLE 860MM WIDTH  Large mop to sweep dust or wipe up water from floors.  Furnished with long handle.', 1604, 2353, 3.0, 21, 45000.00, 25000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4135, 638, 7, 'product', 1767, '174275', 'SPRING CLAMP MOP COMPLETE  Quick-way type spring clamp eliminates cutting or untangling.  Merely slide off the old mop head and slide on the new one, takes just seconds.', 1767, 2354, 24.0, 21, 170000.00, 120000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4136, 638, 8, 'product', 1284, '510462', 'SPARE MINI ROLLER 100MM WIDTH  Small sized rollers designed for painting radiators, trim or other narrow surfaces.  Acryl & Polyester Type and Microfibre type are available.', 1284, 846, 200.0, 21, 5000.00, 2000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4137, 638, 9, 'product', 2273, '612612', 'HAMMER CHIPPING WITH HANDLE, 450GRM  Designed for removing boiler, scale, rust or paint on vessels, etc.  Forged from a special grade of steel.  Handle made of hard wood.', 2273, 2355, 36.0, 21, 90000.00, 58000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4138, 638, 10, 'product', 2984, '613686', 'SHOVEL STEEL SQUARE 1050MM  Blade is forged in one piece from a solid bar of special treated steel for heavy duty work.', 2984, 2356, 6.0, 21, 120000.00, 70000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4139, 638, 11, 'product', 1435, '794397', 'CABLE REEL EXTENSION AC220V, 50MTR  Portable reels which are suitable for use in a work place which is separated from an electrical power source.  Available for use with cord lengths from 20 mtrs to 50 mtrs.  Contains built in outlets that provide power connections for tools and equipment.   When ordering, please specify the required cord length, voltage, ampere, type of plug and receptacle currently in use so that reel can be used properly with your equipment.', 1435, 2357, 1.0, 19, 1350000.00, 825000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4140, 638, 12, 'product', 2693, '851547', 'GAS SPAN 2.5% VOL (50%LEL), METHANE BALANCE AIR 20LTR  Span Gas for all types of gas detectors and analyzer.  To help comply with standards, various types of calibration gas cylinders are available for your usage.  The most important accessory to any gas detector is a calibration kit, which provides the means to determine if the instrument is working properly.  When using gas detection equipment, it is necessary to calibrate the equipment on a regular basis to guarantee accurate results.  According to some regulations and standards, one must test the gas detector prior to each use with a suitable test gas.  Type of Mixture Gases:  A span gas comes in aluminum alloy cylinder.   Please specify kind of gas with capacity of cylinder you request selecting from standard ranges in the following table.  If other Mixtures are required, please specify Gas Type and Concentration.', 2693, 2358, 1.0, 34, 11000000.00, 7000000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4141, 638, 13, 'product', 2985, '851056', 'EARTH CLAMP W/WELDING CABLE, EL200+SKM25-9MM 25MM2 L:5MTR   A spring type earth clamp connected with welding cable.   Welding cable neoprene HO-1/N2-D.', 2985, 2359, 1.0, 21, 145000.00, 90000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4142, 638, 14, 'product', 2986, '110550', 'SUNGLASSES PLASTIC FRAME  Various types of sunglasses are available.  When ordering, please specify the material, frame shape and lens colour.', 2986, 2360, 10.0, 38, 32000.00, 15000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4143, 638, 15, 'product', 1944, '174188', 'PLASTIC BAG W/SELF FASTENER, 280X400MM 100''S  Ordinary transparent plastic bag with fastener which can be easily sealed by sliding over the bag opening between thumb and forefinger.  Helps prevent the articles inside from becoming damp and dusty.', 1944, 2361, 200.0, 36, 5000.00, 1500.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4144, 638, 16, 'product', 1769, '174280', 'WRINGER MOP BUCKET PLASTIC, 330X340X280MM  A handy foot pedal device to wring out the mop without bending over.  The size is 330 x 340 x 280 mm made of hard plastic or galvanized steel with a steel wringer frame.  For preventing cross contamination of different areas, various colours are available for sanitary management.', 1769, 2362, 6.0, 21, 550000.00, 325000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4145, 638, 17, 'product', 884, '190101', 'GLOVES WORKING COTTON ORDINARY  Woven from cotton thread and machine knitted, fitting smooth to the hands.  One size fits all.', 884, 2363, 120.0, 17, 45000.00, 31000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4146, 638, 18, 'product', 2987, '232363', 'RAT GUARD 600MM, FOR 73MM ROPE DIA  Fitted closely on hawsers and lines to prevent rats from boarding the ship.  Conforms with all quarantine regulations.', 2987, 2364, 12.0, 21, 275000.00, 150000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4147, 638, 19, 'product', 662, '232907', 'RAG COTTON OVER 100% STERILIZED, WHITE  Available in white, light-colour or coloured type rags.  All material has been thoroughly washed and sterilized.  One bundle contains five 4-kg packets.  Sold by kg.', 662, 1242, 300.0, 3, 25000.00, 14000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4148, 638, 20, 'product', 2988, '232950', 'SAND FINE 25KG  Used for scrubbing wood decks, extinguishing fires, and in mixing cement.  Packed in a strong plastic bag containing approx. 25 kgs.', 2988, NULL, 3.0, 33, 0.00, 0.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4149, 638, 21, 'product', 2989, '232957', 'CEMENT QUICK-DRY 25KGS  Used chiefly as a coating for tanks, bilges, etc. Supplied 25 kg or 40 kg per package in a durable paper bag.', 2989, NULL, 2.0, 33, 0.00, 0.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4150, 638, 22, 'product', 262, '350241', 'HOSE PLASTIC TRANSPARENT, 50X58MM  The extreme clarity makes it most suitable for application where visibility of flow is an important requirement.  It can be easily flushed clean.  It is resistant to sunlight and abrasion and is easy to handle.  The hose can be twisted or knotted without any damage.', 262, NULL, 1.0, 13, 0.00, 0.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4151, 638, 23, 'product', 2990, '591627', 'SUMP PUMP ELEC LIFT 15MTR, 0.25M3/MIN AC200V 3-PHASE  For permanent or portable application and ideal for loading anywhere there is an accumulation of water.  Furnished for a 110 volt or 220 volt  and 440 volt power supply.', 2990, NULL, 1.0, 19, 0.00, 0.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4152, 638, 24, 'product', 2991, '730121', 'ELBOW MALLEABLE CAST IRON, BLACK 45DEG 1  Standard malleable cast iron fittings used for low pressure water, oil, steam, air and gas line fabrication.  The screw thread for these fittings conforms to the Taper Pipe Threads of JIS B 0203 equal to the ISO 7/1 (Pipe Thread where pressure tight joints are made on the threads).  Available in galvanized or black (ungalvanized), when ordering specify which type is required.', 2991, NULL, 10.0, 21, 0.00, 0.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4153, 638, 25, 'product', 2992, '730122', 'ELBOW MALLEABLE CAST IRON, BLACK 45DEG 1-1/4  Standard malleable cast iron fittings used for low pressure water, oil, steam, air and gas line fabrication.  The screw thread for these fittings conforms to the Taper Pipe Threads of JIS B 0203 equal to the ISO 7/1 (Pipe Thread where pressure tight joints are made on the threads).  Available in galvanized or black (ungalvanized), when ordering specify which type is required.', 2992, NULL, 10.0, 21, 0.00, 0.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4154, 638, 26, 'product', 2993, '794320', 'CABLE HALOGEN-FREE UNARMOURED, HFF-CXP 0.6/1KV6.0MM2X1C BLACK  The remarkably improved fire safety and environmental friendly cables for the ship, not emitting toxic burning fumes or thick smoke owing to Halogen-free insulation cover.  Halogen-free refers to the absence of Halogens, such as Chlorine and Fluorine, and they doesn’t emit any harmful Hydraulic Chloride gas while existing PVC (Polyvinyl Chlorine) dose.   In addition to above attractive features, the Halogen-free covered cable reduces cable weight and size to a minimum and still maintain quality, enabling easy installation.   The Halogen-free range of cables are frame-retardant (IEC 60332-3).  The following designations are used for insulation materials and sheathing materials, and all materials are halogen-free; Insulation : XLPE stands for Cross-linked Polyethylene compound, and it has excellent mechanical and electrical characteristics. Sheathing: The designation SHF1 stands for Thermoplastic compound, and this material is Halogen-free, highly flame-retardant and has low smoke emission.  The listed cables are for fixed installation on all areas and on open deck in ships.  However, if the cable is exposed to direct sun light protective covering or cable with black outer sheath is recommended.', 2993, NULL, 100.0, 13, 0.00, 0.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4155, 638, 27, 'product', 2994, '851658', 'CONTAINER STORAGE FOR WELDING, ROD 450MM WITH STRAP  A waterproof yellow coloured storage containers for welding rods of 350 mm or 450 mm with carrying strap.   A diamond shape to prevent the canister from rolling off a work surface.   The cap is sealed with a pressure fitted O-ring to prevent intrusion of moisture and contaminants.', 2994, NULL, 2.0, 21, 0.00, 0.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
  (4156, 638, 28, 'product', 2995, '851026', 'HOLDER ELECTRODE CLOSED HEAD, 500AMP  Closed Head  A high quality closed head electrode holder with optimal insulation and powerful grip on the electrodes.   Also be used for overhead welding, and electrodes can be inserted in various manners.   Standards : EN 60974-11.', 2995, NULL, 3.0, 21, 485000.00, 230000.0, 5.0, FALSE, 1, 1),
